   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Order matters in unmake: the arrow may lie on frm.\nClearing it first, then moving the amazon back,\nrestores the exact board. The reverse order\nwould erase the amazon.",
   "originalText": "Order matters in unmake: the arrow may lie on frm.\nClearing it first, then moving the amazon back,\nrestores the exact board. The reverse order\nwould erase the amazon.",
